# redshift_rls_policy_attachments (Data Source)

Lists which row-level security policies are attached to which relations for which users, roles, or `PUBLIC` in one
database, including attachments Terraform does not manage. See AWS
[SVV_RLS_ATTACHED_POLICY](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SVV_RLS_ATTACHED_POLICY.html).

